sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Attacker
  participant MFA as Push Provider
  participant User

  Attacker->>MFA: send push request
  MFA-->>User: push notification
  User-->>MFA: ignore request
  loop repeated
    Attacker->>MFA: send push request
    MFA-->>User: push notification flood
  end
  User->>MFA: approve from fatigue
  MFA-->>Attacker: access granted
